<title>USA: Upper Peninsula Energy Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Upper Peninsula Energy Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUGHTON, Mich. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>UPPER PENINSULA ENERGY CORPORATION</p>
<p>			  Twelve Months Ended  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				December 31	    December 31</p>
<p>			  1996	 1995	   1996	  1995</p>
<p> Revenues    $58,302,000 $61,105,000  $14,841,000 $14,919,000</p>
<p> Net Income    5,130,000   5,291,000    1,421,000     367,000</p>
<p>Avg. Shares</p>
<p>  Outstg.	2,969,215   2,969,215    2,969,215   2,969,215</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share</p>
<p>			  1.73	  1.78	   0.48	  0.12</p>
<p>NOTES - Q4 '96 net up because of resumption of normal level of maintenance expenditures after increase in scheduled maintenance expenditures for Q4 '95.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Upper Peninsula Energy Corp.</p>
</text>
